    AuthMW --> AuthorizationMW
    AuthorizationMW --> ApiReqLogMW
    ApiReqLogMW --> ApiAuthMW
    ApiAuthMW --> ApiRateLimitMW

    %% Middleware → Endpoints
    ApiRateLimitMW -->|Route to Pages| AuthPages
